   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **William Tell bridge**: rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n- **Drumz & Drone**: rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **deadco2023-07-08.neumann_skm140.sunboy.flac24** (recommended): source not stated; 21 songs; 197 min [1]\n- **deadco2023-07-08.neumann_skm140.sunboy.flac16**: source not stated; 21 songs; 197 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Taper positioned beside the right side of the mixer enclosure, in the front corner, with mics on a large stand at 13 feet [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **deadco2023-07-08.neumann_skm140.sunboy.flac24**: taped by Steve Weld; transferred by Steve Weld; source: Neumann SKM 140(AK40's/LC3's/KM100's)>HQRP xlr>Aeta PSP3>xlr-1/8\" mini>Sony PCM-M10 @24bit/96kHz [1]. Also: Recorded with Neumann SKM 140 microphones (AK40/LC3/KM100 capsules) through an Aeta PSP3 preamp into a Sony PCM-M10 at 24-bit/96kHz; Transfer from the PCM-M10 micro SD master was edited, mastered and converted in Sound Forge Pro [1]\n- **deadco2023-07-08.neumann_skm140.sunboy.flac16**: taped by Steve Weld; transferred by Steve Weld; source: Neumann SKM 140(AK40's/LC3's/KM100's)>HQRP xlr>Aeta PSP3>xlr-1/8\" mini>Sony PCM-M10 @24bit/96kHz [2]",
